00:09:13.450 --> 00:09:14.951
WOULD BE CONFIRMED.

00:09:14.952 --> 00:09:16.652
IF THE PRESIDENT SAID THIS IS

00:09:16.653 --> 00:09:18.554
THE GUY WE WANT, I THINK CHRIS

00:09:18.555 --> 00:09:19.355
CHRISTIE WOULD GET CONFIRMED.

00:09:19.356 --> 00:09:21.190
I DON'T THINK IT'S MUCH OF A

00:09:21.191 --> 00:09:21.624
PROBLEM.

00:09:21.625 --> 00:09:23.225
I DO NOT THINK THAT BEACH

00:09:23.226 --> 00:09:24.627
CLOSURE IS GOING TO KNOCK HIM

00:09:24.628 --> 00:09:25.828
OUT OF IT, OKAY?

00:09:25.829 --> 00:09:26.796
THAT'S MY VIEW.

00:09:26.797 --> 00:09:28.331
JOE, GIVE ME SOME THOUGHTS ON

00:09:28.332 --> 00:09:29.966
THAT.

00:09:29.967 --> 00:09:30.299
KRISTI?

00:09:30.300 --> 00:09:32.969
&gt;&gt; CHRIS CHRISTIE WOULD BE FINE.

00:09:32.970 --> 00:09:34.003
HE'S EXPERIENCED, HE'S SMART,

00:09:34.004 --> 00:09:37.173
HE'S INTELLIGENT.

00:09:37.174 --> 00:09:37.907
HE WOULD HAVE THE FULL

00:09:37.908 --> 00:09:38.641
CONFIDENCE OF THE PRESIDENT OF

00:09:38.642 --> 00:09:39.609
THE UNITED STATES WHICH TO ME

00:09:39.610 --> 00:09:41.010
WAS MISSING WITH THE

00:09:41.011 --> 00:09:43.279
RELATIONSHIP WITH JEFF SESSIONS.

00:09:43.280 --> 00:09:45.881
THE PRESIDENT IS ENTITLED TO

00:09:45.882 --> 00:09:47.683
HAVE A FULL-TIME

00:09:47.684 --> 00:09:49.986
ATTORNEY GENERAL.

00:09:49.987 --> 00:09:50.586
&gt;&gt; Laura: ANDY McCARTHY,

00:09:50.587 --> 00:09:55.024
WHAT ABOUT CHRISTIE?

00:09:55.025 --> 00:09:56.158
&gt;&gt; I'VE HAD MY POLICY DOES

00:09:56.159 --> 00:09:59.562
AGREEMENTS WITH HIM, BUT NO ONE

00:09:59.563 --> 00:10:00.363
CAN QUESTION HIS CREDENTIALS.

00:10:00.364 --> 00:10:01.664
I AM WORRIED THE BRIDGE GATES

00:10:01.665 --> 00:10:03.165
THING WOULD BE MORE OF A PROBLEM

00:10:03.166 --> 00:10:06.535
THAN I THINK YOU ARE

00:10:06.536 --> 00:10:07.536
CALCULATING, BECAUSE I THINK

00:10:07.537 --> 00:10:08.237
THEY WOULD TRY TO RELITIGATE

00:10:08.238 --> 00:10:10.006
THAT WHOLE THING.

00:10:10.007 --> 00:10:11.240
&gt;&gt; Laura: REPUBLICANS IN THE

00:10:11.241 --> 00:10:11.807
SENATE AREN'T GOING TO

00:10:11.808 --> 00:10:14.577
RELITIGATE IT.

00:10:14.578 --> 00:10:16.379
IF THE PRESIDENT SAID, I KNOW

00:10:16.380 --> 00:10:18.381
HIM, HE'S NOT GOING TO WILT

00:10:18.382 --> 00:10:20.049
UNDER PRESSURE, HE'S NOT GOING

00:10:20.050 --> 00:10:23.152
TO GO, "RECUSAL, RECUSAL,

00:10:23.153 --> 00:10:24.053
RECUSAL" -- HE HAS A GOOD

00:10:24.054 --> 00:10:25.621
RELATIONSHIP WITH MUELLER.

00:10:25.622 --> 00:10:30.793
HE'S NOT BEEN ON TV SAYING IT'S

00:10:30.794 --> 00:10:31.961
A WITCH HUNT.

00:10:31.962 --> 00:10:33.029
HE'S BEEN DISPASSIONATE IN HIS

00:10:33.030 --> 00:10:37.566
OVERALL ANALYSIS, ANDY &gt;&gt; YET --

00:10:37.567 --> 00:10:40.736
NO, LOOK, ALL OF THAT IS TRUE.

00:10:40.737 --> 00:10:42.104
I THINK IT WOULD BE MORE OF A

00:10:42.105 --> 00:10:43.740
PROBLEM THAN YOU

00:10:44.174 --> 00:10:48.010
DO IN TERMS OF THE WAY IT PLAYS

00:10:48.011 --> 00:10:48.611
OUT IN A

00:10:48.612 --> 00:10:49.178
CONFIRMATION HEARING.

00:10:49.179 --> 00:10:52.014
I THINK HE WOULD DO A GOOD JOB.

00:10:52.015 --> 00:10:54.884
BY THE WAY, HIS LAWYER IN BRIDGE

00:10:54.885 --> 00:10:58.988
GATE WAS CHRISTOPHER WRAY.

00:10:58.989 --> 00:11:00.022
&gt;&gt; Laura: THE TANGLED

00:11:00.023 --> 00:11:00.589
TENTACLES ALL AROUND.

00:11:00.590 --> 00:11:03.592
WE'LL LET YOU GO.

00:11:03.593 --> 00:11:04.360
WHAT DO THE REPUBLICANS HAVE IN

00:11:04.361 --> 00:11:05.561
STORE IN THE HOUSE OF

00:11:05.562 --> 00:11:07.596
REPRESENTATIVES WITH SUBPOENA

00:11:07.597 --> 00:11:08.831
POWER, ALL THESE VERY ANXIOUS

00:11:08.832 --> 00:11:10.766
DEMOCRATS WHO HAVE BEEN OUT OF

00:11:10.767 --> 00:11:15.738
POWER FOR A WHILE, EMOLUMENTS

00:11:15.739 --> 00:11:18.374
CLAUSE, BUSINESS DEALINGS?

00:11:18.375 --> 00:11:20.609
&gt;&gt; IT HAS THE PROMISE OF GETTING

00:11:20.610 --> 00:11:21.010
REALLY UGLY.

00:11:21.011 --> 00:11:23.412
I THINK THE WHITE HOUSE IS

00:11:23.413 --> 00:11:25.214
GOING, AND THE ADMINISTRATION IN

00:11:25.215 --> 00:11:25.948
GENERAL, ARE GOING TO HAVE TO

00:11:25.949 --> 00:11:30.219
MAKE SOME VERY HARD DECISIONS

00:11:30.220 --> 00:11:32.054
WANT THINGS TO FIGHT, WHEN TO

00:11:32.055 --> 00:11:33.222
FIGHT, AND HOW TO FIGHT.

00:11:33.223 --> 00:11:35.458
BUT THEY ARE GOING TO HAVE TO

00:11:35.459 --> 00:11:36.826
FIGHT.

00:11:36.827 --> 00:11:37.793
&gt;&gt; Laura: AGAIN, CHRIS

00:11:37.794 --> 00:11:39.595
CHRISTIE IS A FIGHTER.

00:11:39.596 --> 00:11:40.830
ANYONE WHO'S SEEN HIS OLD PRESS

00:11:40.831 --> 00:11:42.998
CONFERENCES, AMONG THE MOST

00:11:42.999 --> 00:11:44.100
ENTERTAINING.

00:11:44.101 --> 00:11:44.600
HE'S REALLY SMART.

00:11:44.601 --> 00:11:46.202
&gt;&gt; THAT'S TRUE.

00:11:46.203 --> 00:11:47.803
I THINK IT'S REALLY IMPORTANT

00:11:47.804 --> 00:11:49.505
THAT SOMEBODY AT THE TOP OF THE

00:11:49.506 --> 00:11:52.041
JUSTICE DEPARTMENT, PARTICULARLY

00:11:52.042 --> 00:11:53.709
WITH THESE ISSUES CANNOT BE A

00:11:53.710 --> 00:11:54.877
REAL PROSECUTOR NOW.

00:11:54.878 --> 00:11:57.113
&gt;&gt; Laura: WHO KNOWS HOW TO DO

00:11:57.114 --> 00:11:57.379
IT.

00:11:57.380 --> 00:12:02.184
THAT WAS A DEFICIT FOR

00:12:02.185 --> 00:12:02.918
JEFF SESSIONS FOR JEFF SESSIONS

00:12:02.919 --> 00:12:04.587
I THINK IS A VERY NICE PERSON.

00:12:04.588 --> 00:12:06.021
HE'S PHENOMENAL ON SO MANY OF

00:12:06.022 --> 00:12:08.357
THE ISSUES THAT TRUMP CARES

00:12:08.358 --> 00:12:09.892
ABOUT AND WAS GREAT -- I LOVE

00:12:09.893 --> 00:12:11.594
WHAT HE'S DOING ON THE MARIJUANA

00:12:11.595 --> 00:12:11.894
THING.

00:12:11.895 --> 00:12:15.164
I'M WITH THEM ON THAT.

00:12:15.165 --> 00:12:15.865
HE IS TEMPERAMENT VERSUS REAL

00:12:15.866 --> 00:12:17.466
NUTS AND BOLTS EXPERIENCE IN

00:12:17.467 --> 00:12:19.969
THAT REGARD.

00:12:19.970 --> 00:12:22.605
&gt;&gt; WELL, AND HE HAD ANOTHER

00:12:22.606 --> 00:12:24.406
PROBLEM WHICH IS THE

00:12:24.407 --> 00:12:25.174
PRESIDENT INSISTS ON PEOPLE WHO

00:12:25.175 --> 00:12:27.777
HAVE COMMAND PRESENCE.

00:12:27.778 --> 00:12:28.544
THAT IS CERTAINLY SOMETHING

00:12:28.545 --> 00:12:29.311
WHICH CHRIS CHRISTIE WOULD BRING

00:12:29.312 --> 00:12:30.246
TO THE JOB.

00:12:30.247 --> 00:12:33.449
WITH ROBERT MUELLER SPENDING

00:12:33.450 --> 00:12:36.485
MORE THAN $38 MILLION TO PRODUCE

00:12:36.486 --> 00:12:37.286
ABSOLUTELY NOTHING BY WAY OF

00:12:37.287 --> 00:12:41.390
RUSSIAN COLLUSION, CHRISTIE

00:12:41.391 --> 00:12:43.826
WOULD BE THE PERFECT OVERSEER OF

00:12:43.827 --> 00:12:44.326
THAT MONSTROSITY.

00:12:44.327 --> 00:12:46.195
&gt;&gt; Laura: BEFORE I LET YOU GO,

00:12:46.196 --> 00:12:49.231
ANDY, DOES THE MUELLER

00:12:49.232 --> 00:12:51.734
INVESTIGATION -- HOW DO YOU SEE

00:12:51.735 --> 00:12:52.535
IT DEVELOPING AT THIS POINT WITH

00:12:52.536 --> 00:12:55.171
THE CHANGE OF SESSIONS?

00:12:55.172 --> 00:12:56.238
&gt;&gt; I THINK IT'S PROBABLY PRETTY

00:12:56.239 --> 00:12:58.274
RIGHT.

00:12:58.275 --> 00:13:00.075
I THINK MUELLER IS TOWARDS THE

00:13:00.076 --> 00:13:02.978
END OF WHAT HE'S DOING ANYWAY.

00:13:02.979 --> 00:13:04.947
I THINK YOU WANT A WARTIME

00:13:04.948 --> 00:13:05.015
CONSUL

00:13:10.987 --> 00:13:14.456
CONSIGLIERE.

00:13:14.457 --> 00:13:16.859
DID I PRONOUNCE THAT RIGHT, JOE?

00:13:16.860 --> 00:13:18.961
&gt;&gt; YES, YOU DID.

00:13:18.962 --> 00:13:22.398
&gt;&gt; Laura: HAVE YOU NEVER

00:13:22.399 --> 00:13:24.066
WATCHED "THE GODFATHER?"

00:13:24.067 --> 00:13:24.433
FANTASTIC.

00:13:24.434 --> 00:13:26.702
THANK YOU SO MUCH FOR YOUR

00:13:26.703 --> 00:13:27.036
INSIGHT.

00:13:27.037 --> 00:13:27.636
WILL YOU COME BACK?

00:13:27.637 --> 00:13:30.172
&gt;&gt; I LOVE YOU.

00:13:30.173 --> 00:13:31.674
&gt;&gt; Laura: MUCH BETTER THAN JOE

00:13:31.675 --> 00:13:33.844
AND ANDY.

